{"data": {"status": true, "competition": {"id": 1762222, "visibility": "public", "theme_colour": "blue_un", "paid": 0, "title": "ICC CodeClash 2026", "festival_id": null, "organization_id": 1644447, "web_url": null, "start_date": "2026-09-27T00:00:00+05:30", "end_date": "2026-10-09T16:00:00+05:30", "location": null, "type": "hackathons", "public_url": "hackathons/icc-codeclash-2026-chandigarh-university-uttar-pradesh-1762222", "region": "online", "details": "<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n<h3>From Coding Fundamentals to Competitive DSA</h3>\n<p>ICC CodeClash 2026 is a two-stage coding competition designed to challenge participants across programming fundamentals, coding logic, problem-solving, and Data Structures &amp; Algorithms (DSA).</p>\n<p>The competition consists of an <strong>Online Virtual Coding Round</strong> followed by an <strong>Offline Final Round</strong>. Participants will first compete in Round 1, and qualifying participants will advance to the Final Round.</p>\n<p><strong>Important Communication:</strong></p>\n<p>After registering for ICC CodeClash 2026 on Unstop, all participants are requested to join the official WhatsApp group for important announcements, round details, instructions, updates, and further communication.</p>\n<p><strong>Official WhatsApp Group:</strong><br /><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/CbZU0qrnx6s2u6I6Jc2E75\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/CbZU0qrnx6s2u6I6Jc2E75</a></p>\n<p><strong>Competition Structure:</strong></p>\n<p>ICC CodeClash 2026 will be conducted in two stages:</p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &rarr; Qualify &rarr; Final Round</strong></p>\n<p>Participants will first take part in the Virtual Coding Round. Based on their performance, qualifying participants will advance to the Offline Final Round.</p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Virtual Coding Round:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Date:</strong> 4 October 2026 (Sunday)<br /><strong>Mode:</strong> Online / Virtual<br /><strong>Platform:</strong> Hack The Future</p>\n<p>Round 1 will consist of basic coding and programming problems designed to test participants on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Programming Fundamentals</li>\n<li>Coding Logic</li>\n<li>Problem Solving</li>\n<li>Logical Thinking</li>\n<li>Coding &amp; Implementation</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Participants will be evaluated based on their performance in the coding round.</p>\n<p><strong>Qualification for Final Round:</strong></p>\n<p>Participants who successfully <strong>qualify Round 1</strong> will advance to the Offline Final Round.</p>\n<p><strong>Only Round 1 qualifiers will be eligible to participate in the Final Round.</strong></p>\n<p>Participation in Round 1 alone does not guarantee entry into the Final Round.</p>\n<p><strong>No certificate will be provided for Round 1.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Final Round &ndash; Offline Coding Competition:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Date:</strong> 9 October 2026 (Friday)<br /><strong>Mode:</strong> Offline<br /><strong>Venue:</strong> Chandigarh University, Uttar Pradesh</p>\n<p>The Final Round will be a time-bound coding competition focused on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data Structures &amp; Algorithms (DSA)</li>\n<li>Problem Solving</li>\n<li>Coding Logic</li>\n<li>Algorithms</li>\n<li>Implementation</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Qualified participants will compete in an offline coding environment and demonstrate their DSA, coding, and problem-solving skills.</p>\n<p><strong>Prizes &amp; Recognition:</strong></p>\n<p>Final Round participants will have the opportunity to receive:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exciting Prizes</li>\n<li>Goodies</li>\n<li>Coupons</li>\n<li>Certificates</li>\n<li>Other Rewards &amp; Recognitions</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Detailed prize information will be mentioned separately in the <strong>Prize Section</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Participation Process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Register for <strong>ICC CodeClash 2026</strong> on Unstop.</li>\n<li>Join the <strong>official WhatsApp group</strong> after registration.</li>\n<li>Participate in the <strong>Virtual Coding Round on 4 October 2026</strong>.</li>\n<li>Perform well and <strong>qualify Round 1</strong>.</li>\n<li>Qualified participants will advance to the <strong>Offline Final Round</strong>.</li>\n<li>Participate in the Final Round on <strong>9 October 2026</strong>.</li>\n<li>Compete for exciting prizes, certificates, goodies, coupons, and other recognitions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Skills Assessed:</strong></p>\n<p>The competition will assess skills including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Programming Fundamentals</li>\n<li>Coding</li>\n<li>Problem Solving</li>\n<li>Logical Thinking</li>\n<li>Algorithms</li>\n<li>Data Structures</li>\n<li>Data Structures &amp; Algorithms (DSA)</li>\n<li>Competitive Programming</li>\n<li>Coding &amp; Implementation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Dates:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>4 October 2026 (Sunday)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Virtual Coding Round</strong><br />Online via Hack The Future</p>\n<p><strong>After Round 1</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Evaluation &amp; Qualification of Participants</strong></p>\n<p>Qualifying participants will advance to the Final Round.</p>\n<p><strong>9 October 2026 (Friday)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Final Round &ndash; Offline Coding Competition</strong><br />Chandigarh University, Uttar Pradesh</p>\n<p><strong>Recognition:</strong></p>\n<p>Final Round participants will have opportunities for <strong>prizes, certificates, goodies, coupons, and other rewards and recognitions</strong>.</p>\n<p>Detailed information regarding prizes and recognitions will be provided in the <strong>Prize Section</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Important Instructions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must follow all rules, instructions, and timelines communicated by the organizers.</li>\n<li>Participation in Round 1 is mandatory for consideration for the Final Round.</li>\n<li><strong>Qualifying Round 1 is mandatory for Final Round participation.</strong></li>\n<li>Only participants who qualify Round 1 will be eligible for the Offline Final Round.</li>\n<li>Round 1 will be conducted online through <strong>Hack The Future</strong>.</li>\n<li>The Final Round will be conducted offline at <strong>Chandigarh University, Uttar Pradesh</strong>.</li>\n<li>Participants should regularly check the official WhatsApp group for important announcements and updates.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Code. Compete. Qualify. Conquer.</strong></p>\n<p>Take on <strong>ICC CodeClash 2026</strong>, showcase your coding skills in the Virtual Coding Round, qualify for the Final Round, and compete for exciting prizes and recognition.</p>", "overall_prizes": "Top 3: Unstop Merchandise, Certificates & ICC LinkedIn Recognition. More rewards coming soon!", "regn_open": 1, "regn_type": 1, "regn_url": null, "regn_email": "", "registration_clicks": 0, "user_id": 33430404, "moderation_status": 1, "overall_leaderboard": 0, "reject_reason": null, "display_date": null, "created_at": "2026-09-27T10:20:26+05:30", "updated_at": "2026-09-28T22:35:36+05:30", "communication_sent": null, "certificate_at": null, "remarks": null, "branding": 0, "disable_auto_rounds": null, "certificate_config": null, "subtype": "online_coding_challenge", "combined_leaderboard": null, "source": null, "short_id": "Fbk6CQq", "hashtags": null, "participation_certificate": 1, "winner_certificate_at": null, "listed": 1, "self_moderated": 2, "prizes_release_days": 1, "checked": 2, "display_title": null, "show_discussions_only_user": 1, "show_reviews_only_user": 1, "show_score_card": 0, "players_count": 106, "referral_leaderboard_show": 0, "is_ad_free": 0, "enable_gamify_leaderboard": 0, "tpo_college_id": null, "publish_at": "2026-09-27 11:13:07", "auto_shortlist_trigger": false, "enable_ai_discussion": false, "total_unlock_teams": 0, "enable_hiring_automation": false, "auto_send_participation_certificate": true, "closed_at": null, "linkedInEventId": "", "teams": [], "players": [], "logoUrl": "https://d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net/uploads/images/75x75/uploadedManual-6ab8ad5d594b7_cu_logo.